My name is Willem and I lead
the data science platform

00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:49.540
team at GOJEK.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:52.420
So we're an engineering team
embedded within data science

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:57.610
at GOJEK, and our main focus
