operates at GOJEK.

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:05.170
So today, I'm going to be
talking a little bit about some

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:08.590
of the pains we had scaling
our data and email pipelines

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:10.660
and how Kubeflow Pipelines
helped us to address

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:13.490
some of those patterns.

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:15.040
So who or what is GOJEK?

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:18.860
GOJEK is an Indonesian
