and we have 19
different services that

00:22:46.830 --> 00:22:49.150
mold up into one super app.

00:22:49.150 --> 00:22:51.750
And there's one
singular goal, and that

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:55.510
is to solve every workday
need that you have.

00:22:55.510 --> 00:22:57.950
So a little bit about our scale.

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:00.750
GOJEK is originally
an Indonesian company,

